Tested @hark_labs vs @muse to book a flight. Muse got stuck on the site and failed. Hark booked it with my specs, but froze after I changed a detail—had to restart.

Hark wins, but both have a long way to go. Thought agents were further along.

@adcock_brett @finkd @alexandr_wang

Grokbot today on a task i asked it to ballpark time of execution 

@bot “no longer than a day”

me: Ok… let’s do it… fire away 

6mins later

@bot “all done… Everything’s configured and installed”

I love Grokbot
